Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:51.09,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}啊啦啊啦 肚子咕嚕咕嚕唱著歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.09,0:22:54.30,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,125)}哎喲喲 腦袋也轉著圈兒跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.30,0:22:57.47,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}別忘了吃今天的早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.47,0:23:00.68,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}（啦啦啦啦早餐！ 啦啦啦啦吃吧！）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.68,0:23:03.81,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,125)}到底是日式料理還是西餐呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.81,0:23:06.98,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,83)}（啦啦啦啦早餐！ 啦啦啦啦吃吧！）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:10.02,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,125)}米飯 納豆 味增湯 海苔 荷包蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.02,0:23:13.03,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,125)}吐司 加沙拉 菜肉蛋捲 牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.03,0:23:16.11,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}好 讓我們盡情吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:19.28,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}這是早起的獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.28,0:23:22.41,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}好啦 大家一起來吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.41,0:23:25.20,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}堅持到中午
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.75,0:23:28.71,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,83)}牛奶含鈣多
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.87,0:23:31.88,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,84)}蔬菜維生素豐富
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.88,0:23:34.96,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,125)}大豆蛋白質含量高
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:37.67,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,83)}營養平衡很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.38,0:23:41.35,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(84,84)}每一天的開始
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.51,0:23:44.64,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,125)}如果空著肚子總會覺得少點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.64,0:23:47.64,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}要讓身體動起來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.64,0:23:50.35,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,84)}一定要吃美味的早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美麗的花壇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.09,0:00:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮的噴水池
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.01,0:00:09.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豪華的住宅
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:11.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  真想成為有錢人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  正因為這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.39,0:00:18.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我們來到了水瀨集團會長的居所
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}強巴魯醬  等等  好了好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:22.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是可愛的小狗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}強巴魯醬真是調皮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:29.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是在直播嗎  真抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:31.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是這裡的家屬嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  水瀨伊織  15歲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在龍宮小町組合中的偶像哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶像？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.15,0:00:40.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.39,0:00:44.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的呢  確實有幾個小字是這麼寫的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:49.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此  小伊織是水瀨財團的千金啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:54.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  有那麼出色的父親和哥哥真是幸福呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.07,0:00:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都托他們的福了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父親平時…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天向大家好好介紹一下超級偶像  水瀨伊織的私人生活哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}放手呀  這可是在直播著啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.58,0:01:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}大小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真有兩下呢  伊織
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.29,0:01:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  要到什麼時候才去伊織的家裡去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.67,0:01:27.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起博物館  我更想看伊織家呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼話啊  彌生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在螢幕上的就是伊織的家呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.39,0:01:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}來吧  各位  馬上成為伊織的fan吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打掃起來似乎會很辛苦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡有問題啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.91,0:03:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鼓勵我們努力經營才是製作人該做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話是這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:23.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是搞不好也會自毀形象的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是利用了下機會而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕事先討論一下也好啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也能作為製作人提供下意見…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龍宮小町的負責人是律子才對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.39,0:03:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:44.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然大家都是765事務所的夥伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.44,0:03:46.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也希望能為大家出點力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼煩惱或哪裡難受的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:52.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很樂意跟你們談談
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.49,0:03:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是打算給大家當製作人的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不需要你的意見呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:04.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想讓人依靠的話  就再努力一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說那個節目也太亂來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.93,0:04:19.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼叫「有那麼出色的父親和哥哥真是幸福呢」啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織在跟父親還有哥哥吵架嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:25.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那倒沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:29.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是擅自認定我就是成為不了偶像
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想讓他們刮目相看而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這心情我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也老是被老哥看扁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.41,0:04:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過就是出生稍微早了一點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就瞧不起人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.87,0:04:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生家情況怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐弟間不吵架嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一家六口  小打小鬧天天有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.72,0:04:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是大家都很要好呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.39,0:05:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真想消遣下吃點美味的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:03.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,響  彌生  一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.73,0:05:04.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我請客哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真走運
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.61,0:05:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然好想去  但還要回去做晚飯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.20,0:05:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  不介意的話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.07,0:05:16.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就來我家吃晚飯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.83,0:05:19.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在彌生家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:19.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}好像很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:25.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是平民的超市嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是第一次來  不過真是齊全呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:32.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織沒有買過東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備飯菜是廚師做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:41.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我來請你們吃沖繩料理哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.93,0:05:43.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  好期待
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有苦瓜呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:49.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣不行啊  伊織
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要好好挑選
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.78,0:05:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這東西不都一樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:05:58.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:01.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  這袋量更多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.33,0:06:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花椰菜也是這個比較新鮮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.87,0:06:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黃瓜也是凹凸不平的更好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芋頭也是帶泥的便宜  而且有營養
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不精挑細選可不行呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.09,0:06:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是彌生嗎  真是辛苦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:21.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有的事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  雖然有點早
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:25.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是放血貼一點半價貼紙好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:32.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要哪個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…那請給我這個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  彌生真有你的  眼光真好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,於是買那麼多豆芽菜要幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:46.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是週四慣例的豆芽菜祭哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽上去就像是熱鬧不起來的祭典呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不會呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.21,0:06:54.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有趣的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.05,0:06:57.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平時都是彌生做晚飯的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:07:01.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父母總是工作到很晚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:06.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備飯菜還有看管弟弟們都是我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎  彌生真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:12.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我和伊織都會全力幫忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧  伊織
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  當…當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:18.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鏘  歡迎來到我家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:25.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔喔  二層住房呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比強巴魯醬的家還要小…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.17,0:07:31.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.58,0:07:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家在家乖嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回來啦  很乖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.42,0:07:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}彌生姐  你回來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.13,0:07:38.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}有不認識的大姐姐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:44.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  一起做藝人的朋友哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.85,0:07:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請多指教哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨～
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}快點啦  來這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}力氣真大呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:55.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生姐  浩三的牛奶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.69,0:07:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,買來了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.03,0:08:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還買了很多豆芽菜哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.95,0:08:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓響和伊織幫忙帶了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}這不是老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}是倉鼠哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的名字叫哈姆藏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:10.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咚～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.54,0:08:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要來嗎  看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咚～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}咚～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:21.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}我說你們  這樣對客人不禮貌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}就這樣  別介意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  幹活咯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.13,0:09:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伸手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:42.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伸手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它伸不了手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:47.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經坐下了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.69,0:09:55.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不去玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:57.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一點點地幫一些自己力所能及的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生姐還得忙她偶像的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  味道不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.71,0:10:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飯做好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:20.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.05,0:10:27.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這好像只有豆芽菜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  所以才叫豆芽菜祭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算只有豆芽菜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也非常美味哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  豆芽菜祭正式開始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.65,0:10:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,switch  on！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是現在  烤肉超人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烤肉拳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  好黑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:58.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}跳電閘了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:10:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  我只是想看烤肉超人…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs22}不要動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.75,0:11:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  真是莫名其妙的家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.67,0:11:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,充滿驚險呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:11.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.14,0:11:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.07,0:11:28.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織  再不吃要沒了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會…會吃的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出乎意料挺美味的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.71,0:11:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秘訣是這特製醬汁哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:46.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是超級美味啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.01,0:11:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  苦瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還剩下一根  就買了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  彌生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.93,0:11:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是感動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,響和伊織能來  我真的好高興
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.40,0:12:05.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還幫我那麼多忙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天都來該多好呢  開玩笑啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼來第二彈了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.95,0:12:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長介哥哥  不吃嗎  那我吃了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥他打我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.55,0:12:34.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長介  為什麼把弟弟弄哭了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為浩司他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是該打的吧  向浩司道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:43.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼  是浩司不對的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.81,0:12:46.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為長介是大哥哥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:49.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不是一直都叫你讓著大家的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦  快道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊  說得這麼了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:05.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明光顧著做自己喜歡的偶像
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:10.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐什麼的最討厭了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長介
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長介怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.07,0:13:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  來繼續豆芽菜祭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放著不管沒關係嗎  彌生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  沒關係  肚子一餓就會回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:51.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有回來呢  長介
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.22,0:13:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會不會是在朋友家裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:58.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打過電話了  都說沒去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有點受打擊呢  長介竟然會那麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以為要是成為偶像來努力的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.36,0:14:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多少能給大家幫上些忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想應該不是真心這麼說的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他還說「姐姐偶像工作很忙  多少希望能幫點忙的」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.38,0:14:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長介嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生  我也經常讓動物跑掉  但也會馬上就追上去的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最親的親人要是出了什麼事  不是很不得了的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出什麼事…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分頭找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:53.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊織  能幫忙照顧一下弟弟他們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.91,0:15:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能找到長介嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.79,0:15:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離家出走了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.71,0:15:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這叫做「蒸發」哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦好啦  你們快進裡面去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.55,0:15:17.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.55,0:15:20.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「蒸發」是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.51,0:15:22.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這樣的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以啊  就是「蒸發」啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.27,0:15:27.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「要是遇到什麼麻煩了」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.27,0:15:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「我可是打算給大家當製作人的啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防萬一而已  以防萬一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.32,0:15:43.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長介  長介
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長介
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.19,0:16:13.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.86,0:16:22.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑到更遠的地方去了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會是出什麼事故了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不會的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是長介出了什麼事  我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.05,0:16:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生  響
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:45.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,製作人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.55,0:16:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接到伊織的電話了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長介呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.77,0:16:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:00.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別擔心  彌生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.86,0:17:03.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:06.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  分頭找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了  一進被窩就馬上睡覺哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.04,0:17:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是一直醒著的話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:20.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會有妖怪出來的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:24.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.94,0:17:37.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  沒看到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:40.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎  謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:47.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  還沒找到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:56.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  正在分頭找著
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:18:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一找到就會聯絡你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.80,0:18:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難得伊織我來拜託你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.43,0:18:10.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我好好工作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.39,0:18:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  如果伊織離家出走的話會去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.65,0:18:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道  我怎麼知道平民的想法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己家裡就有很多能躲的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.95,0:18:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己家裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.69,0:18:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:19:02.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和哥哥們吵架的時候也經常躲在儲物間哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有哥哥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.78,0:19:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  兩個都很出色  還整天把我當白癡  所以經常吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:14.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然現在也還是那樣啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:19.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.75,0:19:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  彌生姐一邊做著偶像  還一個人做家裡的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.55,0:19:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是打算努力來幫忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  結果總是惹她生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.60,0:19:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是姐姐你的話  能懂我的心情…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:38.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不懂  一點都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.06,0:19:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想讓彌生認可你對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.57,0:19:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼就別逃避了  要正面迎上去才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.57,0:19:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少我是這麼做的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.46,0:20:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彌生她啊  不管什麼時候都笑嘻嘻地努力著
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:10.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從沒讓我們看到「家裡的事好累」這樣的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.76,0:20:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是彌生的尊嚴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:16.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你也有尊嚴的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就成為能用自己的力量幫助姐姐的男人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.77,0:20:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「尊嚴」是？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.81,0:20:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺胸向前的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.61,0:20:31.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長介
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.49,0:20:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.58,0:20:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.09,0:20:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  彌生姐  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.95,0:21:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然有兄弟姐妹就是好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.74,0:21:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶爾也給老哥發點簡訊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.12,0:21:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不發哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.91,0:21:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在成為頂級偶像前我才不會低頭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你  伊織
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:30.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打電話給我了  讓我有點高興呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:37.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說  說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:41.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨叫隨到的方便的傢伙也就只有你了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.10,0:21:45.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過結果還是沒派上什麼用場
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.23,0:21:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  沒辦法反駁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.53,0:21:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再好好多努力一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:54.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣的話就下次再叫你出來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.95,0:21:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  會加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.91,0:21:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:05.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去叫大家起床
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.96,0:22:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  長介
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.09,0:22:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從今天開始自己起床
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.42,0:22:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去叫大家起床
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.01,0:22:18.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.30,0:22:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長介  好可靠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.06,0:22:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尊嚴哦  尊嚴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:31.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.36,0:22:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早飯做好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.53,0:23:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下週的偶像大師
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.74,0:24:00.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是秋月律子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直說了  下週是全國的男士必看的治癒回哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.95,0:24:08.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近勞累的你  還沒見過的你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.41,0:24:09.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬請期待
